4{x}^{2}-3{y}^{2}-40x+6y=-85?$" :question/worked-solution "The equation of a horizontal hyperbola centered at $(h,k)$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{(x-h)^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{(y-k)^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nTo rewrite the equation of the hyperbola in the above form, we need to group $x$ and $y$ terms and complete the squares, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4{x}^{2}-3{y}^{2}-40x+6y & =-85 \\\\ 4{x}^{2}-40x-3{y}^{2}+6y & =-85 \\\\ 4[{x}^{2}-10x]-3[{y}^{2}-2y] & =-85 \\\\ 4[(x-5)^{2}-25]-3[(y-1)^{2}-1] & =-85 \\\\ 4(x-5)^{2}-100-3(y-1)^{2}+3 & =-85 \\\\ 4(x-5)^{2}-3(y-1)^{2} & =12 \\\\ \\frac{(x-5)^{2}}{3}-\\frac{(y-1)^{2}}{4} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{(x-5)^{2}}{(\\sqrt{3})^{2}}-\\frac{(y-1)^{2}}{{2}^{2}} & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the center is $(5,1).$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-116113/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "223e29c9-1bb5-51ee-9ec8-4d5c15363951"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-116113"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-274640/field-1/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "ed4fb367-1a3b-53ca-bb96-044ead1ef6cb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-274640/field-1/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" :answer/id #uuid "73b0a139-0d9f-5ea9-8f58-953f53638df6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-274640/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "2262b843-6256-5ded-b498-e4c29780e91b" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-274640/field-1/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer-field/choices ["q-274640/field-1/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" "q-274640/field-1/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate